  npcName: Luke
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 879771316d3537d4b8a631d56dd98ff2, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - There he is! My favorite troublemaker!
  - And yet, you keep coming back!
  - Yeah sorry about that. But trust me, it's worth it.
  - " Un caf\xE9, por favor."
  - This.
  - ' Not just any book. This belonged to Alejandro Vargas. '
  - 'Alejandro Vargas! The legendary explorer! '
  - 'According to the legend, Vargas hid three priceless treasures somewhere around
    Valdoria before he died. '
  - 'Exactly! It''s his journal. His notes, his maps, everything! '
  - ' Long story. The important thing is, I found it. '
  - 'That''s the part I can''t figure out. '
  - ' It was with the journal. Some kind of cipher disc, I think. '
  - ' Yeah. Look at the symbols. They''re the same ones Vargas drew in his journal. '
  - ' For hours. I keep turning the rings, but nothing happens. '
  - What instructions?
